    {
      "id": "280:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:63740:63742"
    },
    {
      "id": "280:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你转过身，在空地边缘的树木前站着亚历克斯。她的衣服上飞溅着泥土，头发里缠着断枝。但她在这里，她活得好好的，她在冲着你笑。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:63742:63804"
    },
    {
      "id": "280:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“宝贝，”她说，“没事了。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:63804:63820"
    },
    {
      "id": "280:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要张开双臂跑向亚历克斯，转到 279。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:63820:63841"
    },
    {
      "id": "280:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要迟疑，转到 10。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:63841:63853"
    }
  ]
}
